{"author":{"id":"5698b6d16d951325374257d86a2e673da0e55970c3d21c0f7c6f49018f24e5bf"},"ops":[{"type":2,"timestamp":1786509617,"nonce":"Ypij6yT9k6gU1LN/gLEBwY0Q6l8=","title":"Nothing builds or publishes an oto image: the chart's default `image.repository` names a registry path no workflow writes to","was":"**What is wrong.** `.github/workflows/` holds exactly one file, `ci.yml`, with eight jobs — `go-lint`, `go-build`, `go-test`, `contract-dto`, `contract-server`, `ui`, `vocabulary`, `reachability`. **Not one of them builds a container image.** `buildx`, `docker/build-push-action`, `docker push` and `packages: write` appear nowhere in the tree; the string `ghcr.io` appears exactly once in the whole repository, and it is `deploy/helm/oto/values.yaml:43` — the chart's default `image.repository`, `ghcr.io/thulasiram/oto`. `justfile` has no docker, image or release recipe: its only `docker` lines are `docker compose` for the local infra stack (`justfile:42`, `justfile:48`)."}]}